_olex2_refinement_description    
;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  All C(H,H) groups, All N(H) groups
 At 1.5 times of:
  All N(H,H) groups
2. Shared sites
{Ag1, N3}
3. Restrained distances
 N3-H3A = N3-H3B = N4-H4A = N4-H4B
 0.9 with sigma of 0.01
 H3A-H3B \\sim H4A-H4B
 with sigma of 0.01
4. Uiso/Uaniso restraints and constraints
Uanis(Ag1) = Uanis(N3)
5. Others
 Sof(H3A)=Sof(H3B)=0.33333*(1-FVAR(2))
 Sof(N3)=0.1667*(1-FVAR(2))
 Sof(Ag1)=0.1667*FVAR(2)
 Fixed Sof: H4A(0.333333) H4B(0.333333)
6.a Ternary CH refined with riding coordinates:
 N1(H1), N2(H2)
6.b Secondary CH2 refined with riding coordinates:
 C1(H1A,H1B), C2(H2A,H2B)
